# Formats read/written by the GraphInOut Property Graph (PG) reader.
# Object ids reference the graph-format-registry (https://github.com/calpano/graph-format-registry).
# 'pg-format' (Property Graph Exchange Format, JSON variant) is not yet a registered format id.

graphinout-reader-pgformat ..has type.. tool
graphinout-reader-pgformat ..label.. GraphInOut Property Graph Reader
graphinout-reader-pgformat ..reads.. pg-format
graphinout-reader-pgformat ..writes.. pg-format
